            'a7689167-f84b-5d77-bf09-6c70a608b2a9', 'res-keben-1989', 'book', '英语 粤教粤人版 三年级起点 六年级 上册 2022版', '粤教粤人版 六年级', '不知不觉，同学们都已经变成咱们学校的大哥哥、大姐姐了，大家的心情肯定无比激动吧？这学期大家将会和Gogo、Tony、Jenny一起，参与更多的英语学习活动，带朋友们乘车、逛街、购物、品尝美食，到野外植树和清理垃圾等。另外，大家还将了解到关于我国中秋节和端午节的许多知识呢！',
            'primary', '六年级', '上册', '英语', '粤教粤人版', '', '',
            'https://image.xuebaw.com/covers/textbook/1989.webp', 'PDF', '85.2 MB', 96,
            288, 192, true, true,
            '{"source": "keben.app", "keben_id": "1989", "matched_key": "小学/六年级"}'::jsonb, '["Do you know ... ?", "Feeling Sick What’s wrong with you? I (hurt my foot). Let me have a look. Be careful next time. I (have a stomachache). Please take some medicine. What’s the matter? I (have a cold).", "Culture 1: Health and Our Earth", "Keeping Clean What was (your bedroom) like (this morning)? It was (messy). Is it (tidy) now? Yes, it is. (My books) were (on the floor) this morning. They are (on the desk) now.", "A Circus in the"]'::jsonb, NOW(), NOW()
